            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Miranda, V., Mealey-Farr, R., and Gozani, O. (2024). Characterization of eEF1A Methyltransferase N6AMT2. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/tv857zh0257. https://doi.org/10.25740/tv857zh0257.",
